The Secretary of State said that the Ministry of Environment has been building 10 observation towers in Battambang, Banteay Meanchey, Oddar Meanchey, Prey Veng, Takeo, Kampot, Kep and Kampong Cham. Seven towers have been completed and put into operation, and three towers have been selected and are under construction.
