On behalf of the Cambodian people and the mine action community in Cambodia, the Senior Minister expressed his gratitude and appreciation to Samdech Techo Prime Minister, the Father of Peace, who ended the war and provided complete peace to the Cambodian people throughout the country. At the same time, Samdech Techo always thinks about the health, safety and livelihood of the people by considering mine action as one of Samdech's priority tasks in resolving after the war.
