6- Continue to provide policies to support people with disabilities, including the provision of travel and food policies to people with disabilities who receive medical services at rehabilitation centers and the opening of health care policies to people. Poor people with disabilities in the community will provide livelihood support to poor people with disabilities, such as housing construction and employment development loans.
