Interior Ministry spokesman: 43 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses on April 9 yesterday
(Phnom Penh): At least 43 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on April 9, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on April 10, 2023.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 43 suspects, 26 were arrested in 14 criminal cases and 17 were arrested in six drug offenses.
