The Deputy Chairman of the Working Group also called on the people to continue voting for the Cambodian People's Party so that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, continues to be the Prime Minister to lead and develop the country to be more prosperous and supportive. Candidate Dr. Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister.
Taking this opportunity, Thol Phea also advised local leaders to increase good deeds, increase care for the well-being and give love to the people, the voice of support will definitely increase.
He also mentioned the achievements of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) over the past 44 years, starting from the victory over the Pol Pot regime and the unification of the Khmer nation through the introduction of a win-win policy of Samdech Techo. Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Thol Phea stated that the purpose of the Cambodian People's Party is to serve the people so that the people can have a better life, this is our big goal.
In addition, Mr. Thol Phea also thanked the people who continue to support the Cambodian People's Party, especially support the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and also called on all people to continue to participate. Preserve the peace that Cambodia has hardly found so that it will not be lost.
