(Pursat): Mr. Net Pheaktra, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Environment, stated that Cambodia has ambitions to expand the sales area of carbon credit to more than 2 million hectares, while currently Cambodia has more than 1.4 million hectares. Carbon credits are sold on the voluntary market.
