He said that the water park according to the music, people want to see not only the people of Kampong Chhnang, but also in the provinces also want to see, so from today, people as well as tourists passing through and Visiting Kampong Chhnang province, you will definitely see this modern water park in front of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Hall.
