Samdech Techo Hun Sen Advises Acharya to Discuss with the Owner of the Case of Putting His Son to the Left or Right (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Arrange for marriage to be discussed with the original owner in advance, the matter of placing the groom sitting side by side on the left or right side of the bride, to avoid spoiling the protocol due to the owner's dispute with the priest.
This suggestion was made on the occasion of Samdech Techo Hun Sen meeting with a total of 1,500 priests and nuns from all over the country on April 8, 2023, coinciding with the celebration of the International Day of Buddhism on April 8.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo mentioned the point of organizing a wedding ceremony, which always has an abbot as the organizer of ceremonies such as saluting, cutting hair, wanting hands. The prince advised the abbot who arranged the wedding ceremony to discuss with the original owner in advance the matter of placing the groom sitting on the left or right side of the bride to avoid spoiling the ceremony due to the owner's dispute with the abbot.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the abbot not to quarrel with the original owner or to demand that the rules be followed and to force the original owner to place his son on the left or right side.
The Prime Minister forbade the rule to force the family to accept, that is, to ask each other first so as not to spoil the ceremony.
Samdech Techo said, "Ask the original owner first, if the original owner, according to the tradition that they used to put the man on the right, please follow the original owner, but in the case of the original owner It is said that it is up to the acha, so the acha manages himself. ”
He stressed that after Samdech appealed to banks and microfinance on April 7 yesterday in the Cabinet meeting to avoid the confiscation of property to those who can not afford it. Some people who have loans with banks or microfinance have money and do not repay the bank, while those institutions also provide a lot of favors.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's remarks were made on the occasion of Samdech's meeting with Achar Acharini in Koh Pich on the morning of April 8, 2023.
Samdech Techo added: "The government is requesting a credit restructuring for bank debtors to understand the difficulty of repayment, etc. It may take some time, but not based on this problem, the bank does not have money." And do not pay.
At the same time, Samdech added that if any person incites politics to link the debt of banks and microfinance by propaganda that if the party wins and does not pay, let those banks and microfinance institutions take action to sue. Court to confiscate the person's property so as not to cause further trouble.
