Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Cambodia's foreign policy maintains good relations with neighboring countries, regions and the world in response to the development of the world (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): In the meeting of the Council of Ministers this morning, April 7, 2023 Samdech Techo Hun Sen reaffirmed Cambodia's foreign policy in response to the new context of regional and global order.
In response to this new context, Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia continues to pursue a foreign policy that maintains good diplomatic relations with neighboring countries and countries in the region and the world, safeguarding Cambodia's core interests in accordance with the Constitution, guaranteeing sovereignty and territorial integrity. Independence, peace and socio-economic development.
