On the occasion of the Khmer New Year, the year of Thao Chatva Sak, BE 2566 AD 2023, "Borey Nadi" would like to wish you, ladies and gentlemen, happiness, good luck, good health, success in all tasks. And happy family. In particular, please do not forget to come and receive a lot of prizes and promotions on the occasion of the New Year from Borey Nadi.
Police arrest two Chinese nationals after detaining and severely abusing another Chinese national in Po Sen Chey district, victims rescued
(Phnom Penh): The police force of Po Sen Chey district, in cooperation with the Samrong Krom police station, launched an operation to rescue and liberate a Chinese man who was beaten and detained at home by the same Chinese man with a bandage over his mouth and handcuffs. Parrot wings surround the back. The victim was also successfully assisted by the police force.
