Prior to the incident, residents of the New World Borey Chhouk Va 2 near the scene reported to authorities that two Chinese suspects had acted violently against another Chinese man.
Upon receiving this information, the police immediately arrived at the scene, but the two suspects tried to escape, while the police and residents chased the two suspects and sent the suspects. A man was arrested after raping a 13-year-old girl in Por Sen Chey district.
(Phnom Penh): Police from the Criminal Police Department, in cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, Po Sen Chey District Police Inspectorate and the Child Protection Organization (CPU), arrested a suspect after raping a 13-year-old girl in Po Sen Chey District. .
According to the police, the operation to arrest the above suspects took place at 1:30 AM on April 6, 2023 at Teuk Thla Village, Sangkat Teuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh, under the direct guidance of General Sandibandit. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner and Commander, led by Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department, Ministry of Interior.
According to the police, after receiving strict orders from Brigadier General Dr. Neth Savoeun, Brigadier General Hun Moniroth, Deputy Director of the Criminal Police Department of the Ministry of Interior, led the cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner's Office of Minor Crimes, Po Sen Chey Police Inspectorate and NGOs. Child protection, also known as CPU, has been researched, targeted and arrested.
According to the police, on March 28, 2023, the suspect Chea Thearith, 38, rode a motorbike to buy a cocktail at the victim's house in Borey Piphop Thmey Chhouk Va 2, where the suspect disguised himself as a teacher. Confirmed to the victim's mother that she was a teacher and had a ninth grade exam.
At the southern Krasang pagoda, Chea Thearith pushed the girl into an old bathroom in the south Krasang pagoda and threatened the victim with a knife to rape her. Then, after the action, Chea Thearith threatened the victim not to shout, if she dared to shout, she would stab herself to death.
Chea Thearith then took the girl to a pawn shop to pawn her phone and persuaded her to enter the guesthouse with him, but she refused and Chea Thearith took him. The girl returned to the new Phnom Penh High School and escaped.
Senior officials of the Ministry of Interior tell the authorities at all localities to protect the safety of citizens from crimes, especially drugs
(Koh Kong): Mr. Miech Sophanna, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, told the authorities at all levels to protect the safety of citizens from any crime, especially drug offenses.
He said this while leading the delegation to open a meeting on reviewing and promoting the implementation of the policy of safe villages, communes and sangkats within the jurisdiction of the Koh Kong Provincial Administration, which was held on April 7, 2023 at the Koh Kong Provincial Theater. .
Mr. Mieu Sophanna continued that in order to respond to peace, political stability, Samdech Techo officials from all institutions at the national, provincial, district and local levels must fulfill their duties to serve the people well, regardless of any racist political tendencies.
He said that the authorities at the provincial, district and local levels must provide public services to the people as soon as possible to crack down on all crimes, especially drug offenses, not to exist in their localities. On the other hand, all authorities must have good ethics, respect the role, know how to be united, be professional, fulfill their duties close to the people.
He stressed that there is peace in villages, communes, safe people, well-being and brings poverty reduction and a better life.
